Romenagri: the missing Sanskrit characters, the underscore guards, and the nukta layer
Copyright (C) 1993-2026 Abhishek Choudhary

This package contains three changes to the Romenagri Transliteration System (the
Romenagri/ directory of https://github.com/hindawiai/chintamani, commit
3ad87785a75dc2b18438a8b068807103cb920c81: patch 0001, the missing Sanskrit
characters; patch 0002, the underscore guards of the parser; and patch 0003,
the nukta layer of the Unicode converters), the documentation of how Romenagri
transliterates, the tools and tests that check the changes, a site of five
pages and a notebook that explains them (romenagri-site/), and a narrative of
the conversation in which they were made.

